IL released. ECHILD when"] [131 1 "// pid is no child of this process (no /proc entry, another parent)."] [139 60 "// from field 3, state"] [144 33 "// field 52, exit_code"] [150 59 "// SYS_pidfd_open, the same on amd64 and arm64"] [183 2 "// waitid over wait4 (no siginfo_t without pointers): P_ALL, P_PID, P_PGID; WEXITED, WSTOPPED, WCONTINUED and"] [184 2 "// WNOHANG as wait4's options; si_uid the caller's, si_signo SIGCHLD. WNOWAIT (asyncio's _ThreadedChildWatcher:"] [185 2 "// no asyncio subprocess ended without it) for P_PID and WEXITED alone: waitidNoWait"] [204 11 "// P_ALL"] [205 11 "// P_PID"] [207 11 "// P_PGID"] [216 29 "// WNOWAIT"] [230 71 "// the GIL released while it blocks (PY6f's allowThreads; queue 200, PY6-core)"] [347 2 "// ---- descriptors"] [393 47 "// SEEK_CUR, from the offset on"] [485 2 "// copy_file_range and splice: the system calls when no offset is given; an offset as pread from it or pwrite"] [486 2 "// at it (the calls need a pointer to it), the descriptor's own offset left alone as the calls leave it"] [543 22 "// SYS_copy_file_range: amd64's, arm64's 285 (not in Go's syscall tables)"] [550 2 "// ---- the scheduler"] [570 44 "// musl's sched_getscheduler"] [573 2 "// ---- eventfd, pidfd_open"] [657 71 "// SYS_pidfd_open, the same on amd64 and arm64"] [665 3 "// musl's getlogin: $LOGNAME"] [672 2 "// ---- the environment"]] :go/pos {:name [3 9] :package [3 1]} :go/semis [[23 22] [168 48] [193 24] [311 36] [354 24] [382 122] [397 67] [433 34] [503 25] [567 57] [634 13] [634 20] [666 38] [675 23] [677 27] [680 32]]} (go/file "builtins_posix_ids.go" :build ["//go:build linux"] :imports [


